('115.15.b.10',3,'Which shows kindness during a disagreement?','["insulting", "ignoring", "interrupting", "taking turns talking"]'::jsonb,3,'Taking turns shows respect.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.A',3,'One reason to avoid gangs is that they can...','["lead to danger and trouble", "make you healthier", "teach you school lessons", "give you real friends always"]'::jsonb,0,'Gangs bring risk.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.A',3,'Staying away from violence and weapons helps keep you...','["lost", "safe", "tired", "slow"]'::jsonb,1,'Avoiding violence protects people.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.B',3,'A safe school environment has...','["broken stairs", "danger signs", "rules and trusted adults", "no rules"]'::jsonb,2,'Rules and adults keep school safe.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.B',3,'A safe community has...','["dark alleys", "lots of trash", "no rules", "well-lit streets and helpful neighbors"]'::jsonb,3,'Safe places are cared for.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.C',3,'Mishandling a firearm can cause...','["serious injury or death", "a snack", "a better grade", "a nap"]'::jsonb,0,'Firearms are deadly.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.C',4,'If you find a gun at a friend''s house, you should...','["hide it", "leave and tell a trusted adult", "take it", "play with it"]'::jsonb,1,'Do not touch.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.D',3,'A personal safety plan can include...','["a recipe", "a spelling list", "trusted adults and emergency numbers", "a favorite game"]'::jsonb,2,'It tells you who to call.','original'),
('115.15.b.11.D',4,'A good personal safety plan includes...','["a secret", "a snack", "a joke book", "a safe meeting place"]'::jsonb,3,'Meeting places help in emergencies.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.A',3,'Why is it important to be careful online?','["strangers may not be who they say", "everyone online is a friend", "nothing online is real", "nothing can go wrong"]'::jsonb,0,'Online safety protects you.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.A',3,'A safe online habit is to...','["share your password with friends", "keep passwords private", "post your address", "click every ad"]'::jsonb,1,'Passwords keep accounts safe.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.B',3,'Appropriate online communication includes...','["insults", "rumors", "kind words and polite messages", "private photos"]'::jsonb,2,'Be kind online.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.B',3,'An appropriate way to message online is to...','["tease others", "use mean language", "gossip", "use respectful language"]'::jsonb,3,'Respect applies online too.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.C',4,'Who is appropriate to communicate with online?','["people you know and trust", "anyone who messages you", "any stranger", "anyone who asks"]'::jsonb,0,'Limit online contact to trusted people.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.C',4,'Which information is NOT appropriate to share online?','["a joke", "your home address", "your favorite color", "a school project title"]'::jsonb,1,'Private info stays private.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.D',4,'A consequence of cyberbullying can be...','["a prize", "a new friend", "school discipline and hurt feelings", "a reward"]'::jsonb,2,'Cyberbullying has consequences.','original'),
('115.15.b.12.D',3,'Sharing an embarrassing photo of a classmate online can cause...','["a trophy", "good grades", "a snack", "harm to that person"]'::jsonb,3,'It hurts people and breaks rules.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.A',3,'If you see cyberbullying, a good response is to...','["not join in and tell a trusted adult", "forward it", "laugh", "comment meanly"]'::jsonb,0,'Reporting helps.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.A',3,'One way to respond to bullying is to...','["join in", "stay calm, walk away, and tell an adult", "fight back", "keep it a secret"]'::jsonb,1,'Calm action is safer.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.B',3,'Why ask a trusted adult for help with a safety problem?','["they will tease", "they will laugh", "they can help keep you safe", "they will ignore it"]'::jsonb,2,'Adults help with safety.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.B',3,'If you feel unsafe, a good decision is to...','["wait and see", "ignore it", "handle it alone", "tell a trusted adult right away"]'::jsonb,3,'Seek help early.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.C',4,'Abuse is when someone hurts another person''s body or feelings on purpose, and neglect is when...','["a person''s basic needs are not met", "a person naps", "a person reads too much", "a person plays too much"]'::jsonb,0,'Neglect is failing to provide care.','original'),
('115.15.b.13.C',4,'If someone is being abused, they should tell...','["nobody", "a trusted adult", "only a pet", "a stranger"]'::jsonb,1,'Telling an adult can get help.','original'),
